;; bin/java-project test's case (A16): two modules holding a copy each of one package, as a library's new and old releases on
;; one class path (hamcrest 2.2 before hamcrest-core 1.3): Version differs, Same is equal, OldOnly is the old module's alone.
;; forms.all keeps the first module's Version (the plan's order, a class path's), lists the later one in WORK/classes.shadowed,
;; is silent on Same, and keeps OldOnly
{:java {:release 25
        :modules [{:name "new" :src ["$controls/shadow/new/src"]}
                  {:name "old" :src ["$controls/shadow/old/src"]}]}}
